{# Skill pack: sql_injection #}
## Skill: SQL Injection
applies_when: Use when parameters influence database queries or error text.
target_under_test: {{ target }}
difficulty_level: {{ difficulty_level }}

signals:
  - database error strings, stack traces, boolean-sensitive responses
  - numeric parameters, sort/order parameters, search endpoints
probe_order:
  1. Send a single quote and compare baseline vs error response
  2. Send boolean pairs (true/false predicate) and diff response length
  3. Escalate to sqlmap confirmation with level 2, risk 1, technique BEUSTQ
validation_criteria:
  - deterministic boolean differential, or sqlmap reports an injectable parameter
evidence_required:
  - parameter name, injection technique, and the response diff
constraints:
  - confirmation only: no data extraction, no stacked queries, no file read/write
